NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/21625#issuecomment-4680145357", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/21625", "id": 4680145357, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G88AAAABFvVZzQ", "user": {"login": "teknium1", "id": 127238744, "node_id": "U_kgDOB5WCWA", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127238744?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1", "html_url": "https://github.com/teknium1", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-06-11T11:41:37Z", "updated_at": "2026-06-11T11:41:37Z", "body": "<!-- hermes-sweeper:item=21625 -->\n<!-- hermes-sweeper:verdict=close reason=implemented_on_main confidence=high -->\nThis looks implemented on current `main` now. Automated hermes-sweeper review found that Hermes records skill usage and exposes it through both telemetry and `/insights` / `hermes insights`.\n\nEvidence:\n\n- `tools/skills_tool.py:1580` wraps `skill_view`; on a successful load it calls `bump_view()` and `bump_use()`, so loading a skill is recorded as usage.\n- `tools/skill_usage.py:1` documents the skill usage sidecar at `~/.hermes/skills/.usage.json`, including `use_count`, `view_count`, and timestamps.\n- `agent/insights.py:290` extracts per-skill usage from persisted tool calls; `agent/insights.py:796` renders a `Top Skills` section with loads, edits, and last-used date.\n- `cli.py:7417` and `cli.py:8318` wire `/insights` to that report; `hermes_cli/main.py:10802` wires the standalone `hermes insights` command.\n- The prior discussion here also notes this was a duplicate of #21622, but this close is based on the current main implementation rather than duplicate status.\n\nClosing as implemented on main.\n", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4680145357/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}]